# API key (optional - users set their own in the Settings UI)
# The app is BYOK by default. The browser stores the key in localStorage
# and sends it to /api/chat, which forwards to the user's chosen base URL.
#
# If you want a server-side shared key (NOT recommended for public deploys),
# you can wire this env var in Vercel and modify app/api/chat/route.js to
# fall back to it when the client does not send apiKey.
# OPENAI_API_KEY=
